Licensing by mod and shared component / 按模组及共用组件适用许可

Game directories organize files; they do not assign a license to every mod
for that game. Each mod or shared component has its own license scope.
The licenses below are not interchangeable options for the same code.

Current scopes:
- mods/smtvv/first-person/: MIT; see LICENSE-MIT.
- mods/smtvv/garden-freecam-visibility/: MIT; see LICENSE-MIT.
- mods/smtvv/common/: MIT; see LICENSE-MIT and applicable third-party notices.
- mods/p5r/first-person/: GPL-3.0-or-later; see its LICENSE and
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. LICENSE-GPL-3.0 is a root-level copy of that text.
- Other original repository files: MIT unless explicitly stated otherwise.
- Third-party code retains its own copyright notices and license terms.

New mods must state their license explicitly. A new P5R mod is not covered by
First Person Camera's GPL solely because it is in the same game directory.
Reused code and dependencies still carry their applicable license obligations.
The MIT license does not override First Person Camera's GPL terms; its releases
include a separate corresponding-source archive.

游戏目录只用于分类，不统一决定该游戏下所有模组的许可。
当前许可范围：SMTVV 第一人称、庭院自由视角防透明、共用组件分别采用 MIT；
P5R First Person Camera 采用 GPL-3.0-or-later。
新增模组须明确声明自己的许可，不因放在同一游戏目录就继承其他模组的许可；
复用代码及依赖仍须遵循相应许可。其他原创仓库文件未另行声明时采用 MIT，
第三方内容遵循各自许可。这不是同一份代码可以任选 MIT 或 GPL。
MIT 不覆盖 First Person Camera 的 GPL 条款；该模组发布包另附对应源码。
